WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.536
-I also wanted to play you
in a game of basketball.

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:07.473
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:10.676
Thank you.
MVP -- they're talking about me.

00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:13.013
There's no way I could obviously
beat you in basketball,

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.815
but how about
video-game basketball?

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:17.450
How about "NBA Jam"?

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.020
-I'm in. Let's do it.
Let's do it.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.854
I'm in for that.
-Let's do it right now.

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.522
Let's go.
Let's play some "NBA Jam."

00:00:23.522 --> 00:00:24.991
Let's do this. Here we go.

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:27.193
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:30.196
♪♪

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.064
All right.
-Wait a minute. Wait a minute.

00:00:32.064 --> 00:00:34.099
-Now, I play this game --

00:00:34.099 --> 00:00:35.702
-How --
-What?

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.203
-You play it what? All the time?

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.972
-Well, no, once, twice a year,
something like that.

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:41.641
But I love this game.

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.476
Yeah, this is
"NBA Jam: On Fire Edition."

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:46.479
I played so much
that I unlocked some legends.

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:49.082
So, I'm Larry Bird.
I got to be Larry bird.

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:52.551
-That's fine.
You're Larry Bird.

00:00:52.551 --> 00:00:54.520
-I'm Larry Bird.
-And I'm Russell Westbrook.

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.989
-There you go, man.
All right, so, here's the deal.

00:00:56.989 --> 00:01:01.594
We have one quarter, right?
It's two minutes, and that's it.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:03.429
Whoever wins this
wins the whole thing.

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:05.364
You down?
-Good luck.

00:01:05.364 --> 00:01:07.332
-Who's your teammate,
by the way?

00:01:07.332 --> 00:01:08.567
Mine's Kevin Garnett.

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.102
-Mine's Rumble, baby.

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:13.439
-The mascot?
-Yeah.

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:15.341
-All right. Ready for this?
Here we go.

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.543
-Let's do it.
-Here we go.

00:01:17.543 --> 00:01:19.813
-Let's go, Rumble!
-Go! Come on, Garnett!

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:22.148
-Oklahoma City wins the tip.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:25.384
-Ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh!

00:01:25.384 --> 00:01:27.753
-What?!

00:01:27.753 --> 00:01:29.989
-Bird...

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:31.557
He shoots!

00:01:31.557 --> 00:01:33.259
-Oh, gimme that.
Outta here, Larry.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.962
-Shoots from midrange!
-Good. Larry scored 2.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:38.898
Oh, my God. You already
swatted me. I'm nervous.

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.333
-To Westbrook.

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:42.468
-Yeah! Sit down!
Sit down, dude!

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:44.537
Give me the ball!
Pass it! Dunk it!

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:46.072
No, Larry!

00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:47.874
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:50.109
Yeah!
-Westbrook...

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:53.846
-Ohh! Yes!

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:55.280
Ooh, what's this?

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:57.282
Oh, it's a 3-pointer.

00:01:57.282 --> 00:02:00.420
Ooh! What's up, dude?

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:02.755
Dude, you're getting
a Bird bath right now, dude!

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:04.624
What's up?!
-Lays it up.

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:06.359
-All right. All right.
All right.

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:08.761
-We got a minute.
-7-4. Here we go.

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:11.297
-Passes it.
Oh, homey don't play that.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:12.364
-Ohh!
-Ohh!

00:02:12.364 --> 00:02:14.033
-Oh, get up. Give me that.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:15.234
-Getting physical!

00:02:15.234 --> 00:02:16.869
-No-look. I'm not looking.

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:19.172
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:21.574
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:23.109
-Here's Westbrook!

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:27.347
-Oh. It's all right.
7-10. 7-10. Here we go.

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:29.982
-Gimme that!
-Get that mascot out of here!

00:02:29.982 --> 00:02:32.785
Ohh!

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:34.920
-Give me that!
-Aah!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.456
-To Westbrook!

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:40.026
-Ohh! [ Laughs ]

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:42.327
-Three!

00:02:42.327 --> 00:02:44.497
-Are you running the clock out?
What are you doing?

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:45.598
Ohh!

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:48.568
Tie game! Tie game! Tie game!

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:51.870
♪♪

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.539
-With the bomb from long range!

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:55.374
-Whoo! [ Laughs ]

00:02:55.374 --> 00:02:57.243
Hurry up. 5 seconds left.

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:59.311
-Moving the ball nicely.

00:02:59.311 --> 00:03:00.513
