00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:05.818
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:07.954
-Oh, my goodness!

00:03:07.954 --> 00:03:09.689
-It's a glitch. It's a glitch.

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.691
-Russell Westbrook, everybody.

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:15.895
His new book, "Style Drivers,"
